  <p class="demo__note">适合：卡片内的轻量主操作，如抢购、领取</p>
  <div class="demo__stage"><div class="xbtn-box"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--pill" data-xbtn-t="抢购成功">立即抢购</button></div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-BTN-012" data-name="块级大按钮" data-cat="BTN">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">块级大按钮</span></div>
