    <div class="card list xbtn-inlist">
      <div class="xbtn-pickrow"><img src="../../kit/assets/photo/product-rose-red.webp" alt=""><div class="xbtn-main"><b>红玫瑰花束</b><span class="price"><small>¥</small>199</span></div></div>
      <div class="xbtn-pickrow"><img src="../../kit/assets/photo/product-peony-pink.webp" alt=""><div class="xbtn-main"><b>粉芍药花束</b><span class="price"><small>¥</small>239</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn--primary btn--fab xbtn-fab" aria-label="在线客服" data-tip="在线客服" data-xbtn-t="客服已接入"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/support.webp" alt=""></button></div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-BTN-018" data-name="数量角标按钮" data-cat="BTN">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">数量角标按钮</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：购物车入口，点按后角标数量增加</p>
  <div class="demo__stage"><div class="xbtn-box"><button class="ibtn ibtn--round xbtn-round xbtn-cartbtn" aria-label="购物车" data-tip="购物车" data-xbtn-badge><img data-ic="cart" src="../../kit/assets/icons/flat/cart.webp" alt=""><span class="badge">3</span></button></div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-BTN-019" data-name="带图标按钮" data-cat="BTN">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">带图标按钮</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：图标能强化含义的操作，如联系客服</p>
  <div class="demo__stage"><div class="xbtn-box"><button class="btn btn--primary" data-xbtn-t="客服已接入"><img src="../../kit/assets/line/support.webp" alt="">联系客服</button></div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-BTN-020" data-name="加载中按钮" data-cat="BTN">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">加载中按钮</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：提交后等待结果，防止重复点击</p>
  <div class="demo__stage"><div class="xbtn-box"><button class="btn btn--primary" data-xbtn-load>提交订单</button></div></div>
</article>

